# [CHANGE: claude-code | 2026-09-13] The page, rebuilt from nothing.
#
# What it was: one flex row per item with four fixed-width columns -- a 13 px
# caret, a 170 px bar, an 86 px size and a 132 px action block, plus gaps. That
# is 441 px of fixed width inside a phone's 368 px of content, so `.name`, being
# the only flexible column, collapsed to zero. On a phone this page rendered a
# list of delete buttons attached to blank rows. Restyling could not fix that;
# the layout itself was the bug.
#
# What it is now: a block per item. The title takes the full width and wraps, the
# size sits beside it, the bar and the facts go underneath, and the delete button
# is inside the row's expanded body where you have to open it to reach it.
#
# CSS and JS are served from /app.css and /app.js so this page can carry a CSP
# with no 'unsafe-inline'. They are the same files the landing page uses; the two
# pages are different origins and cannot share a <link>, so both processes serve
# identical bytes from /usr/local/share/luminos/web/.
